00:12:11,420 --> 00:12:12,130
Takeshi's pass

277
00:12:12,880 --> 00:12:13,890
will be decisive!

278
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:18,390
And that's the third goal!

279
00:12:18,570 --> 00:12:22,020
Tsubasa-kun lunged and Morisaki-kun jumped in vain!

280
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:24,520
3-1!

281
00:12:24,700 --> 00:12:30,030
In the 22nd minute, Toho scored a third goal against Nankatsu!

282
00:12:30,370 --> 00:12:33,710
They're creating a huge gap against the champions!

283
00:12:35,210 --> 00:12:38,410
Hyuga-kun has already scored a hat trick!

284
00:12:35,210 --> 00:12:38,410
Hat trick: scoring three goals in one match.

285
00:12:41,460 --> 00:12:44,750
Is he making a victory "V" sign?

286
00:12:45,630 --> 00:12:46,590
Tsubasa

287
00:12:47,100 --> 00:12:48,850
we need two goals to advance,

288
00:12:49,500 --> 00:12:51,510
but soon it'll be 3, then 4

289
00:12:52,100 --> 00:12:55,350
then 5, and even many more!

290
00:12:57,140 --> 00:13:00,230
I know you're not giving your all.

291
00:13:00,690 --> 00:13:03,820
But I'll beat you by a huge margin!

292
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:07,150
I'll destroy you and Nankatsu!

293
00:13:07,570 --> 00:13:11,330
As long as I'm on top, no one can say I'll lose!

294
00:13:11,780 --> 00:13:12,780
Hyuga-kun...

295
00:13:13,280 --> 00:13:15,830
Kojiro is a real tiger.

296
00:13:16,030 --> 00:13:19,030
A ruthless predator thirsty for goals.

297
00:13:19,210 --> 00:13:21,540
Kojiro Hyuga, the wild tiger!

298
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:22,870
Strong.

299
00:13:23,160 --> 00:13:24,840
Hyuga-kun is very strong.

300
00:13:25,620 --> 00:13:28,540
I shouldn't be thinking about saving the Drive Shot.

301
00:13:25,620 --> 00:13:28,540
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

302
00:13:29,130 --> 00:13:32,260
To defeat the current Hyuga-kun,

303
00:13:32,800 --> 00:13:37,510
I must work hard even if my whole body falls apart!

304
00:13:37,760 --> 00:13:39,440
We can't win...

305
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:41,190
They're amazing.

306
00:13:41,190 --> 00:13:42,820
Ah, we won't make it.

307
00:13:42,980 --> 00:13:45,740
Toho passed matches without Hyuga.

308
00:13:46,200 --> 00:13:48,650
And with him, they became even stronger,

309
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:51,270
Toho became a perfect team.

310
00:13:51,650 --> 00:13:55,080
There's no way to stop the Tiger Shot.

311
00:13:51,650 --> 00:13:55,080
Tiger Shot

312
00:13:55,750 --> 00:13:57,780
I can't do anything against that shot.

313
00:13:58,780 --> 00:14:01,340
If only Wakabayashi-san were here...

314
00:14:02,210 --> 00:14:05,120
Those who are not motivated, leave the field.

315
00:14:06,500 --> 00:14:07,370
Tsubasa...

316
00:14:08,220 --> 00:14:09,130
Morisaki...

317
00:14:09,380 --> 00:14:11,600
You are Nankatsu's goalkeeper.

318
00:14:12,170 --> 00:14:14,510
The one who has kept our goal safe so far

319
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:17,730
is not Genzo Wakabayashi, it's you, Yuzo Morisaki.

320
00:14:18,550 --> 00:14:19,510
Tsubasa...

321
00:14:20,390 --> 00:14:24,020
Are you all going to give up just because we're two goals behind?

322
00:14:24,320 --> 00:14:25,390
Have you forgotten our dream?

323
00:14:26,140 --> 00:14:27,820
Our dream...?

324
00:14:28,520 --> 00:14:30,200
A third consecutive championship.

325
00:14:30,520 --> 00:14:33,400
A 3rd championship with Nankatsu,

326
00:14:33,700 --> 00:14:35,280
a dream built together,

327
00:14:35,650 --> 00:14:37,460
our dream alone!

328
00:14:38,410 --> 00:14:39,530
Tsubasa...

329
00:14:42,710 --> 00:14:45,660
Tsubasa! It's over, we can't concede more!

330
00:14:46,040 --> 00:14:50,220
There's no way we'll give up our dreams so easily!

331
00:14:50,590 --> 00:14:53,290
Despite your injuries, you're giving it your all!

332
00:14:53,470 --> 00:14:56,260
Let's play until the end, Tsubasa!

333
00:14:56,550 --> 00:14:58,010
Captain Tsubasa!

334
00:14:58,350 --> 00:14:59,230
Everyone...

335
00:15:00,440 --> 00:15:01,510
Alright, let's go!

336
00:15:01,800 --> 00:15:02,730
YES!

337
00:15:02,980 --> 00:15:05,610
Score three goals together.

338
00:15:05,820 --> 00:15:07,490
Win, Nankatsu!

339
00:15:07,890 --> 00:15:09,320
Pull yourselves together, Nankatsu!

340
00:15:09,490 --> 00:15:11,490
Unite against Hyuga!

341
00:15:14,740 --> 00:15:17,200
Come, Toho! The match isn't over yet!

342
00:15:17,500 --> 00:15:20,460
The last match of our middle school lives!

343
00:15:20,620 --> 00:15:24,090
Winning this match is our shared dream!

344
00:15:24,250 --> 00:15:26,460
We won't give up on this dream!

345
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:28,370
Come, Toho!

346
00:15:29,620 --> 00:15:31,920
Go, Toho's sliding tackle team!

347
00:15:37,220 --> 00:15:37,920
What?!

348
00:15:38,300 --> 00:15:39,420
We'll hold the ball!

349
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:40,940
We'll narrow the gap!

350
00:15:41,300 --> 00:15:43,510
Toho's sliding tackle team failed!

351
00:15:43,690 --> 00:15:46,860
This gap awakened Nankatsu's thirst for victory!

352
00:15:47,140 --> 00:15:48,140
I'll win!

353
00:15:48,320 --> 00:15:48,900
What?!

354
00:15:48,900 --> 00:15:50,740
Hyuga-kun stole the ball from Kisugi-kun!

355
00:15:51,520 --> 00:15:54,270
And in front of the center line, he will shoot,

356
00:15:54,740 --> 00:15:56,450
Tiger Shot!

357
00:15:54,740 --> 00:15:56,450
Tiger Shot

358
00:15:56,900 --> 00:15:58,370
This shot is straight!

359
00:15:58,700 --> 00:16:02,500
If I stand in front of Hyuga-kun, the ball will come to me!

360
00:16:02,830 --> 00:16:03,830
Eat this!

361
00:16:04,210 --> 00:16:05,780
The third goal of this gap!

362
00:16:06,960 --> 00:16:08,540
Tiger Shot fired!

363
00:16:06,960 --> 00:16:08,540
Tiger Shot

364
00:16:08,910 --> 00:16:10,040
You won't score!

365
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:13,840
Tsubasa-kun returns the Tiger Shot!

366
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:13,840
Tiger Shot

367
00:16:14,040 --> 00:16:15,220
W-What?!

368
00:16:15,380 --> 00:16:17,350
Drive Shot!

369
00:16:15,380 --> 00:16:17,350
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

370
00:16:29,140 --> 00:16:30,520
It's in!

371
00:16:30,690 --> 00:16:33,270
That Drive Shot was full of determination!

372
00:16:33,450 --> 00:16:35,200
Wakashimazu-kun could do nothing!

373
00:16:35,520 --> 00:16:36,400
It's in...

374
00:16:37,370 --> 00:16:38,990
You did it, Tsubasa!

375
00:16:39,150 --> 00:16:40,200
Congrats, Tsubasa!

376
00:16:40,620 --> 00:16:41,580
You did it!

377
00:16:41,580 --> 00:16:42,710
More than a goal!

378
00:16:43,030 --> 00:16:44,620
Magnificent! So powerful!

379
00:16:44,780 --> 00:16:45,530
Tsubasa-kun!

380
00:16:48,500 --> 00:16:50,040
I can't believe it!

381
00:16:50,210 --> 00:16:51,590
A miracle happened.

382
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:55,000
Yes. The Tiger Shot was returned...

383
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:55,000
Tiger Shot

384
00:16:55,170 --> 00:16:58,750
He reached the shot and managed to score.

385
00:16:59,220 --> 00:17:01,470
The chance was 1 in 10,000, no...

386
00:17:01,630 --> 00:17:03,760
Or rather, 1 in 100,000.

387
00:17:04,090 --> 00:17:07,440
Tsubasa Ozora did just that.

388
00:17:08,150 --> 00:17:10,350
Truly the Football Kid!

389
00:17:11,100 --> 00:17:12,560
Magnificent, Tsubasa!

390
00:17:12,740 --> 00:17:15,450
Still, can't you use your Drive Shot?

391
00:17:12,740 --> 00:17:15,450
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

392
00:17:15,600 --> 00:17:19,110
That's the only way to beat Hyuga-kun and Toho.

393
00:17:19,660 --> 00:17:21,450
But I didn't think it would score.

394
00:17:21,860 --> 00:17:24,000
I wanted to counter the Tiger Shot.

395
00:17:21,860 --> 00:17:24,000
Tiger Shot

396
00:17:24,460 --> 00:17:27,960
To beat Hyuga-kun, you have to completely surround him!

397
00:17:28,280 --> 00:17:29,460
Now,

398
00:17:29,780 --> 00:17:32,960
even if I fall apart, I'll give everything,

399
00:17:33,500 --> 00:17:35,220
to crush Kojiro Hyuga,

400
00:17:35,500 --> 00:17:37,290
and to defeat Toho Academy!

401
00:17:37,830 --> 00:17:40,300
Come on, let's work hard!

402
00:17:40,300 --> 00:17:41,640
We'll take the 3rd championship!

403
00:17:41,800 --> 00:17:44,050
Let's make our dreams a reality!

404
00:17:44,680 --> 00:17:46,390
That's Tsubasa's power.

405
00:17:46,900 --> 00:17:49,400
A power that prevents me from beating him!

406
00:17:49,940 --> 00:17:51,230
Here we go, everyone!

407
00:17:51,560 --> 00:17:52,310
Hyuga-san...

408
00:17:52,690 --> 00:17:54,990
We still have a one-goal lead!

409
00:17:55,490 --> 00:17:58,990
We'll beat Nankatsu and win our first championship!

410
00:17:59,240 --> 00:18:00,070
Yes!

411
00:18:00,610 --> 00:18:02,950
I could do nothing against that shot.

412
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:06,030
But it won't happen again!

413
00:18:07,530 --> 00:18:13,000
Tsubasa, I'll send your Drive Shot back with my Tiger Shot!

414
00:18:07,530 --> 00:18:13,000
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot
Tiger Shot

415
00:18:13,210 --> 00:18:13,960
Let's go!

416
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:15,040
Let's stop Hyuga!

417
00:18:17,630 --> 00:18:18,720
Come on, Sorimachi!

418
00:18:19,080 --> 00:18:22,720
Hyuga, previously, you would lose your composure

419
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:24,930
and stubbornly try to score.

420
00:18:25,390 --> 00:18:27,050
But not anymore.

421
00:18:27,550 --> 00:18:30,100
Your enthusiasm is always present,

422
00:18:30,260 --> 00:18:34,190
but now you know how to make the right choices to win a game.

423
00:18:34,900 --> 00:18:36,850
Hyuga is playing well.

424
00:18:37,020 --> 00:18:38,060
As you said.

425
00:18:38,350 --> 00:18:39,270
Mikami-san.

426
00:18:39,810 --> 00:18:41,490
Follow me to the center.

427
00:18:41,700 --> 00:18:42,450
Okay.

428
00:18:42,740 --> 00:18:45,070
For the European tour match?

429
00:18:45,360 --> 00:18:47,320
Yes, I have to leave.

430
00:18:48,460 --> 00:18:51,670
After this tournament, the selection day will see the light.

431
00:18:52,030 --> 00:18:53,830
The matured Tsubasa Ozora

432
00:18:54,420 --> 00:18:57,330
or Kojiro Hyuga, who will be the captain?

433
00:18:58,000 --> 00:18:59,790
Fight, Toho! Fight!

434
00:18:59,970 --> 00:19:02,180
Do your best, Nankatsu!

435
00:19:02,500 --> 00:19:03,090
Hyuga-san!

436
00:19:03,500 --> 00:19:07,300
In front of the goal, Toho perfectly passed to Hyuga-kun!

437
00:19:07,480 --> 00:19:08,010
Damn it!

438
00:19:08,840 --> 00:19:10,730
Tsubasa intercepts the pass!

439
00:19:11,010 --> 00:19:11,850
What?

440
00:19:12,010 --> 00:19:13,350
I will win, Hyuga-kun!

441
00:19:13,510 --> 00:19:15,900
I'll give everything I have!

442
00:19:17,600 --> 00:19:20,240
Tsubasa-kun dribbles cunningly!

443
00:19:21,490 --> 00:19:23,110
Your move ends here!

444
00:19:24,110 --> 00:19:26,820
Tsubasa-kun jumped over!

445
00:19:30,500 --> 00:19:31,500
What?

446
00:19:32,570 --> 00:19:33,630
Tsubasa!

447
00:19:34,750 --> 00:19:37,040
Tsubasa-kun suddenly fell!

448
00:19:37,290 --> 00:19:38,750
Players always play on!

449
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:40,250
Get the ball back!

450
00:19:41,540 --> 00:19:43,680
Izawa-kun reaches for the ball!

451
00:19:43,970 --> 00:19:45,970
Will it be the equalizing goal?

452
00:19:46,250 --> 00:19:46,970
Go!

453
00:19:47,720 --> 00:19:48,430
Izawa-kun's shot!

454
00:19:50,800 --> 00:19:52,480
My left arm isn't moving!

455
00:19:53,760 --> 00:19:55,810
Wakashimazu-kun punches the ball!

456
00:19:56,100 --> 00:19:57,810
He denied Nankatsu the goal!

457
00:19:57,980 --> 00:20:00,270
Ken! His left arm really is hurt!

458
00:20:00,700 --> 00:20:04,560
Tsubasa-kun is lying on the ground! His condition worsened!

459
00:20:05,020 --> 00:20:08,280
Because of the miraculous Drive Shot!

460
00:20:05,020 --> 00:20:08,280
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

461
00:20:09,160 --> 00:20:10,250
He endured the Tiger Shot,

462
00:20:09,160 --> 00:20:10,250
Tiger Shot

463
00:20:10,710 --> 00:20:13,110
and repeated the Drive Shot.

464
00:20:10,710 --> 00:20:13,110
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

465
00:20:13,380 --> 00:20:16,330
He suffered even more physical damage!

466
00:20:16,920 --> 00:20:20,880
Nankatsu will take a corner kick, but Tsubasa-kun will be treated!

467
00:20:21,380 --> 00:20:23,500
Tsubasa-kun, the condition of your leg...

468
00:20:24,140 --> 00:20:27,000
Doctor, my leg really hurts!

469
00:20:27,180 --> 00:20:28,000
Of course it does!

470
00:20:28,680 --> 00:20:30,390
The bandage is torn!

471
00:20:30,840 --> 00:20:33,190
I told you not to push yourself too hard!

472
00:20:33,400 --> 00:20:36,230
But Doctor, if I play timidly,

473
00:20:36,510 --> 00:20:38,690
I won't be able to beat Hyuga-kun!

474
00:20:39,270 --> 00:20:42,650
I'm here to win this game!

475
00:20:43,450 --> 00:20:45,950
This half is over. Let's go to the infirmary.

476
00:20:48,240 --> 00:20:51,610
Listen, everyone! We have to do it for Tsubasa!

477
00:20:51,910 --> 00:20:53,670
Our corner kick chance!

478
00:20:53,820 --> 00:20:54,530
Okay!

479
00:20:54,860 --> 00:20:56,570
They haven't noticed yet...

480
00:20:56,750 --> 00:20:58,960
Wakashimazu's left arm is injured!

481
00:20:59,130 --> 00:21:00,580
This corner kick...

482
00:21:00,750 --> 00:21:02,720
We'll never give up defending!

483
00:21:03,130 --> 00:21:06,250
Nankatsu will continue the match without Tsubasa-kun!

484
00:21:08,640 --> 00:21:10,140
The corner kick is taken!

485
00:21:10,300 --> 00:21:11,140
Let's go!

486
00:21:11,300 --> 00:21:12,340
You can't!

487
00:21:13,890 --> 00:21:16,980
It's a trap! The ball is for Ishizaki-kun!

488
00:21:17,230 --> 00:21:18,190
Got it!

489
00:21:21,690 --> 00:21:24,150
Wakashimazu isn't blocking the ball anymore!

490
00:21:24,600 --> 00:21:26,200
Or is he injured?

491
00:21:26,700 --> 00:21:27,520
Alright!

492
00:21:28,020 --> 00:21:29,240
Takasugi's shot!

493
00:21:29,910 --> 00:21:30,990
Imai-kun blocks!

494
00:21:32,360 --> 00:21:34,210
The ball came to Hyuga!

495
00:21:34,360 --> 00:21:35,530
Get back, everyone!

496
00:21:35,920 --> 00:21:37,570
Toho escaped!

497
00:21:37,750 --> 00:21:39,030
It smells like an attack!

498
00:21:39,880 --> 00:21:40,540
What?

499
00:21:41,670 --> 00:21:43,000
H-Hyuga-san?

500
00:21:43,670 --> 00:21:45,500
Nankatsu is playing without Tsubasa...

501
00:21:45,930 --> 00:21:49,040
In that case, victory won't be interesting.

502
00:21:49,840 --> 00:21:50,750
Hyuga...

503
00:21:51,220 --> 00:21:53,980
However, I must fight.

504
00:21:54,230 --> 00:21:58,400
It's necessary for my qualified teammates without me!

505
00:21:59,230 --> 00:22:02,730
Forward, everyone! We'll humiliate Nankatsu!

506
00:22:02,900 --> 00:22:06,990
Without Tsubasa, we'll score 10 goals against Nankatsu!

507
00:22:07,810 --> 00:22:10,360
Don't play just because Tsubasa is away!

508
00:22:10,520 --> 00:22:12,450
Nothing in Nankatsu counts.

509
00:22:12,610 --> 00:22:14,910
We'll hold on to 10!

510
